976 0 obj
<<
/Title (True. When someone is included in the CC field, all recipients of the email can see the email addresses in the CC field. So, if the manager is included in the CC field, Mark will see that the manager received the email as well as that it was sent by John.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
